# packaging/runtime is generated but MUST stay tracked: the git marketplace clones this repo and
# resolves marketplace.json's `source: ./packaging/runtime` inside the clone. While it was
# ignored, every fresh clone lacked the directory and install failed with "plugin source not
# found". `validate.py manifests` keeps the committed snapshot byte-identical to the source.
.workbuddy/
